{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54209","headline":"答楚儿 · 郑昌图","name":"答楚儿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大开眼界莫言冤，毕世甘他（《说郛》本作「必若遭伊」）也是缘。\n无计不烦乾（《说郛》本作「轻」）偃蹇，有门须是疾连拳。\n据论当道加严箠，便合披缁念《法莲》。\n如此兴情殊不（《说郛》本作「都未」）减，始知昨日是蒲鞭。\n（见孙棨《北里志》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑昌图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54209.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54209","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}